arated) of which you want the CDN to serve the content.'=>'Enter the directories (comma separated) of which you want the CDN to serve the content.','CDN Content'=>'CDN Content','Use double slash \'//\' at the start of CDN CNAME, if you have some pages on  HTTP and some are on HTTPS.'=>'Use double slash \'//\' at the start of CDN CNAME, if you have some pages on  HTTP and some are on HTTPS.','https://www.domain.com'=>'https://www.domain.com','Enable to make CDN effective on your website.'=>'Enable to make CDN effective on your website.','Activate CDN'=>'Activate CDN','Mobile Cache'=>'Mobile Cache','Enable this to add expires headers to static files. This will ask browsers to either request a file from server or fetch from the browser\'s cache.'=>'Enable this to add expires headers to static files. This will ask browsers to either request a file from server or fetch from the browser\'s cache.','Browser Cache'=>'Browser Cache','Enable this to compress your files making HTTP requests fewer and faster.'=>'Enable this to compress your files making HTTP requests fewer and faster.','Gzip Compression'=>'Gzip Compression','Automatically purge internal cache after X minutes. By default this is set to 1440 minutes (1 day)'=>'Automatically purge internal cache after X minutes. By default this is set to 1440 minutes (1 day)','Purge Cache After'=>'Purge Cache After','This is the basic cache that we recommend should be kept enabled in all cases. Basic cache will build the internal and static caches for the WordPress websites.'=>'This is the basic cache that we recommend should be kept enabled in all cases. Basic cache will build the internal and static caches for the WordPress websites.','Cache System'=>'Cache System','Use this option to exclude JS files from Minification and Grouping. Enter the URLs of JS files on each line.'=>'Use this option to exclude JS files from Minification and Grouping. Enter the URLs of JS files on each line.','Exclude JS'=>'Exclude JS','Use this option t